        <li><strong>Analyze Operational Margins:</strong> Monitor baseline business margins with our <a href="/gross-profit-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">gross profit calculator</a> and verify post-tax earnings via our <a href="/profit-margin-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">profit margin calculator</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Platform Specific Simulations:</strong> Compare how GST interacts with marketplace deductions using our dedicated <a href="/amazon-profit-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">Amazon seller calculator</a>, <a href="/flipkart-profit-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">Flipkart seller calculator</a>, and <a href="/meesho-profit-calculator/" class="text-emerald-700 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-emerald-900 font-medium">Meesho profit calculator</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="pt-2">
        Bookmark this free <strong>gst calculator</strong> to ensure 100% tax accuracy across every wholesale invoice, retail sale, and marketplace reconciliation in 2026.
